<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (With due respect we, the undersigned students of BBA 31st Batch\(A\), 1st year, 2nd semester have reported on the Leadership in Practice: A Critical Analysis of Sir Fazle Hasan Abed that you authorized on May 07, 2026, under the course F-106 \(Principles of Management\).This paper provides an in-depth analysis of the leadership style, vision, and contributions of Sir Fazle Hasan Abed, the founder of BRAC. It highlights how his innovative and transformational leadership approach has played a vital role in social development and poverty alleviation, both in Bangladesh and globally.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
