304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (Under Abed's leadership, BRAC grew from a small relief project into the world's largest non-governmental organization. By 2019, BRAC operated in 11 countries across Asia and Africa, with a staff of over 100,000 and an annual budget exceeding $1 billion. The organization has directly touched the lives of more than 100 million people, with programs reaching across all 64 districts of Bangladesh. BRAC's reach extends to education \(with over 7 million students enrolled in its schools\), health, microfinance, agriculture, human rights, environmental protection, and social enterprises. Remarkably, BRAC has achieved and maintained its position as the top-ranked NGO globally by NGO Advisor for multiple consecutive years, based on impact, innovation, and sustainability- a testament to Abed's vision of building a sustainable, measurable, and scalable development organization.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
